WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.390
Say you're off sick today.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.720
You can record that here without changing
your rotation.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.400
Find your shift on Today and tap Not
working today.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.540
We'll choose Sick day here, then tap Save.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.110
There's the absence at the top.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.570
It won't count as a shift you've worked.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.510
Your future shifts and Calendar events stay
as they were.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.030
If you need to let your workplace know, do
that separately.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.100
This only records the absence in
RosterEase.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.160
If you picked the wrong reason,

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.920
tap Undo beside the record to go back to
what was there before.
